  "paper_claim": "Figure 11 compares No M/P, baseline M/P, and QOS M/P across utilization targets. Fig. 11(c) must be reproduced as per-application relative fidelity with respect to solo execution, using component records from selected QOS multiprogramming pair simulations under each utilization group and simulation-only execution instead of real QPU access.",
  "pass_rule": "all",
  "tolerance": {
    "avg_relative_fidelity_loss_max": 0.25,
    "effective_util_gain_min_pct": 0.0,
    "fidelity_improvement_min": 1.0
